{
  "id": "reviving-legends-launch-tournament",
  "name": "Reviving Legends launch tournament",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "The tournaments held to launch the LEGEND series expansion Reviving Legends (よみがえる伝説), released on 11 February 2010 with the constructed standard decks Tyranitar and Steelix. From that day Gym Challenge (ジム☆チャレンジ) shops of the official Pokémon Card Gym network held launch tournaments in two leagues, one for elementary school children and younger and an open one, where every player got Scyther 049/L-P or Houndour 050/L-P, one at random, with a holo basic Energy, and the top three got Burned Tower 052/L-P with original card goods and a gold Jirachi coin.\n\nPokémon Challenge Hiroba (ポケモンチャレンジひろば) events held launch battles too, where every player also got Scyther or Houndour and the excellence prize was Legend Box 051/L-P. All four carry the LEGEND and Reviving Legends logos on their pictures.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "pokemon-card.com (archived): 「ジム☆チャレンジ」2月のイベントスケジュール更新！ 拡張パック「よみがえる伝説」の発売にあわせて、発売記念大会を開催！",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20100213182125/http://www.pokemon-card.com:80/info/entry/100211_841.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokumon: Challenge Hiroba (Plaza) Events",
        "url": "https://pokumon.com/challenge-hiroba-plaza-events/"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokeboon: 049/L-P ストライク： ポケモンチャレンジひろば カードゲットバトル 「よみがえる伝説」発売記念大会 参加賞",
        "url": "https://pokeboon.com/jp/049lp-scyther-promo/"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokeboon: 051/L-P レジェンドボックス： ポケモンチャレンジひろば カードゲットバトル 「よみがえる伝説」発売記念大会 優秀賞",
        "url": "https://pokeboon.com/jp/051lp-legendbox-promo/"
      }
    ]
  },
